Reporting hole(s) removed: 2020-07-08
Truth: true_R_epilps, 253 days, Rt 0.619 to 7.802
Seeding: I0 = 2000 on day 1 (NegBin draws from day 2)
Scoring days 2-253 (252 days), 100 replicates, shared across all SI settings

NegBin overdispersion estimated on the observed series: rho = 17.36
  at mu = 1000: SD 242 (NegBin) vs 32 (Poisson), 7.7x the noise

simulated 100 / 100 replicates (0 diverged, 0 went extinct)
median final-day incidence 314

65 unique SI settings to fit (5 families x 13 moment settings;
  70 rows reported, the point the two sweeps share is fitted once per family)
100 replicates x 65 settings = 6500 EpiLPS fits

